        "merged": true,
        "mergeable": false,
        "draft": false,
        "body": "Implements #2 (SYS-FOUND; NFR-03/NFR-06; AC-19): reproducible React/Express/PostgreSQL application foundation with npm workspaces, versioned Prisma migrations and repeatable seed.\r\n\r\n- Four related tables, unique email/session hash, capacity/time checks and partial ACTIVE-registration uniqueness.\r\n- Seed creates 2 organizers, 3 participants and 2 events; repeated runs preserve changed passwords and edited events.\r\n- Local PostgreSQL Compose with separate dev/test databases and volumes; environment examples, setup commands and execution evidence. Local database Compose was approved to resolve the scope conflict; app containers, CI and deployment remain deferred.\r\n\r\nValidation: npm ci, build, migrate and seed passed; 12 server tests and 1 client test passed; npm audit reported 0 vulnerabilities. T-19 checks seed repeat, constraints, foreign keys and data across two real API process starts. Implementation matches tested commit d111892; subsequent documentation edits clarify review/history. Evidence: docs/evidence/sprint-1/issue2-foundation.md and issue2-verification.txt. Contracts: docs/system-sds.md and docs/sprints/sprint-1/specification.md.",
