        "state": "closed",
        "merged": true,
        "mergeable": false,
        "draft": false,
        "body": "Implement :\n- Add event APIs:\n  - POST /api/events\n  - POST /api/events/:id/publish\n  - GET /api/events\n  - GET /api/events/mine\n  - GET /api/events/:id\n- Create events as DRAFT with ownership derived from the session.\n- Validate field limits, capacity and event dates according to Sprint 1 docs.\n- Allow only the owning Organizer to publish; reject repeated publication and events whose start time has passed.\n- List upcoming PUBLISHED events with active registration counts and remaining places.\n- Restrict draft visibility to its owner and expose only the caller’s own myRegistration summary in participant detail.\n- Add Events, My events, Create event and Event detail pages with publication confirmation.\n- Handle loading, empty, validation, error, pending and success states; support Bangkok time and responsive layouts.\n- Separate event routes, services, validation, UI and tests into new files.\n- Update documentation, traceability and execution evidence to reflect the approved requirements.",
